OL,3,GNEWSAAir show cancelled as organiser
OL,4,Afaces liquidation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new air show has been cancelled with
OL,7,Fless than a week to go, with the event
OL,8,Forganiser expected to go into
OL,9,Fliquidation.
OL,11,FHampshire Air Festival had been due to
OL,12,Ftake place at Thruxton Aerodrome, near
OL,13,FAndover, Hampshire, on Saturday and
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FMontserrat Events, which was behind the
OL,17,FVictory Festival and Air Display at
OL,18,FLee-on-the-Solent, said it was with
OL,19,F"profound sadness" that it announced
OL,20,Fthe cancellation.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
